{"baseRefOid":"eb05921bad874cd2a1b4fa5d1149f1ed26576cae","body":"## Summary\n\n- Extend `select` to support native `<select>` elements and standard ARIA `combobox` and `listbox` controls.\n- Match options by exact value, label, or whitespace-normalized accessible text, then use trusted browser input, dynamic option polling, and state verification to complete custom-widget selections reliably.\n- Preserve native multi-select behavior, define final-set semantics for explicitly multiselectable ARIA listboxes, handle active-descendant Enter activation and dialogs, and return actionable errors for unsupported or unverifiable controls.\n- Keep the CLI, MCP, Eve integration, documentation, and agent guidance aligned with the expanded selection behavior, with regression coverage for native, ARIA, filtering, dynamic, and dialog-driven controls.\n\nCloses #1105","files":[{"path":"README.md","additions":8,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/commands.rs","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/mcp.rs","additions":40,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/native/actions.rs","additions":25,"deletions":14,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/native/browser.rs","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/native/e2e_tests.rs","additions":596,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/native/interaction.rs","additions":1589,"deletions":35,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/native/webdriver/backend.rs","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cli/src/output.rs","additions":9,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/src/app/commands/page.mdx","additions":12,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/src/app/quick-start/page.mdx","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/src/app/selectors/page.mdx","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"evals/cases/command-usage.ts","additions":1